Synthesis of coronene-MOF-4: A mixture of $Z n(N O_{3})_{2}{\cdot}G H_{2}O$ $(29.7\ \mathrm{mg},0.10\ \mathrm{mmol})$ , tpt $(10.4~\mathrm{mg},0.033~\mathrm{mmol})$ , abdc $(27.0\ \mathsf{m g},$ $0.10\ \mathrm{mmol}\}$ , coronene $(20~\mathrm{mg},0.067~\mathrm{mmol})$ , ${\mathsf{H B F}}_{4}$ $(100~\upmu\mathsf{L})$ , and $\Gamma\ \forall\mathsf{A c}\ (3\ \mathsf{m L})$ was sealed into a $20~\mathsf{m L}$ glass vial and sealed, which was heated at $120^{\circ}{\mathsf{C}}$ for $72\ h$ in an oven. After cooling to room temperature, orangered block crystals were collected and washed three times with $5\mathsf{m L}$ fresh DMAc.
